WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.677
- How did you do that?

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.243
- That's hypnosis.

00:00:05.421 --> 00:00:08.004
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.500
- Today we're gonna get hypnotized

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.270
