that we may have experienced.

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.460
- I'm very nervous.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.360
I've never been hypnotized,

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.730
because I like to be in
control of myself at all times.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.340
- I'm scared of like being exposed.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.880
And it doesn't mean like necessarily

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.780
just like physically naked.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.650
- I've been practicing
past life regression

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.650
therapy for over 700 years.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.020
Today, we are going to see
three different examples

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.010
of past life regression therapy.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.080
This is when a person chooses an issue

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.950
that he or she would like to overcome.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.730
Then we travel back to who the person was,

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.700
the past life to the event or events

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.600
that are going to illuminate the cause

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.473
of the issue.

00:00:47.473 --> 00:00:49.360
And from there we are able to heal it.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.040
So Joyce, do you mind having the hypnocat

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.440
on your lap.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.170
- No, I completely enjoy it.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.370
- What is your intention for having your

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.420
past life regression?

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.390
- I wanna heal my migraines.

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:02.900
- For today I would like to focus

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:06.050
on my fear of waves and water.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:08.005
- Is there something in your
life you'd like to heal?

00:01:08.005 --> 00:01:10.580
- It's doubt, it's doubt.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.550
- So the induction, is to
go from a full waking state

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.370
down into the hypnotic trance.

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:16.915
- I feel like you're
doing it to me already.

00:01:16.915 --> 00:01:18.181
- I am.
- You are right.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.233
- I am.

00:01:19.233 --> 00:01:21.893
Now I'm gonna show you how
powerful you are Joyce.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:23.563
You are so powerful,

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:25.853
that you can relax your eyelids,

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.710
wonderfully, totally, and completely.

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:30.690
For the subconscious mind
knows how to generate healing.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.903
Your power word is the word trust.

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:36.163
Because you can trust
yourself more and more.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.760
You're now in an alpha state of hypnosis.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:41.333
And we can now hack into
the subconscious mind.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.890
You can imagine or visualize

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:44.723
getting pulled

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:49.293
to an amazing corridor.

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:52.060
And you're gliding through.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:54.050
Three, step into the light.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:55.900
Two, step into the light.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.390
One, step into the light.

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.883
At zero take a big step forward,

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:03.620
you are in another time and another place.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.713
Now look down at your hand,

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:07.670
are you a man or a woman, a boy or a girl?

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:08.503
- Woman.

00:02:08.503 --> 00:02:11.093
- And look at your palms,
and your fingertips,

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:12.880
are you a girl of leisure

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:15.273
or do you work hard with your hands?

00:02:15.744 --> 00:02:18.990
- I don't know, I have jewelry on though.

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:20.480
- Ah tell me about the jewelry.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.673
Describe it.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:24.670
- They're like teeth,
like alligator teeth.

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:27.573
- Yes, and describe the landscape.

00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:29.113
The environment.

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:30.523
- It's like a swamp.

00:02:31.199 --> 00:02:32.993
Like high grass.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:37.113
- Travel to your home in your past life.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:40.093
What does your home look like?

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.743
- [Joyce] It's small, on the countryside.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.233
- [Lisa] And look around
and orient yourself.

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:48.943
Do you know in what land you live?

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:50.550
- [Joyce] Scotland.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:53.550
- [Lisa] What can you see?

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:55.513
- [Kate] I'm in like a canyon.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.080
- [Lisa] And are you alone
or are there other people?

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.070
- [Kate] There's other people.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.050
- Men and women?

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:00.883
Men only?

00:03:00.883 --> 00:03:02.213
- I think it's just men.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:03.193
- Yes.

00:03:03.193 --> 00:03:05.980
Do you know your name or
is someone calling to you,

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:07.020
even a nickname?

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.390
- I heard Alice.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.703
- Yes, Alice.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:11.183
Speak your name out loud.

00:03:13.212 --> 00:03:14.045
- Annabelle.

00:03:14.045 --> 00:03:15.300
- Tell me about your home.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.363
- It's good.

00:03:16.853 --> 00:03:18.773
It's like alligator people.

00:03:19.373 --> 00:03:21.563
The alligator means a lot for us.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:24.660
- See if there's anything that you carry.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:27.233
- I have like tiny bag with me.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:28.893
- I have kids.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.763
- Boys, girls?

00:03:29.763 --> 00:03:30.596
- Boys.

00:03:30.596 --> 00:03:31.429
- How many?

00:03:31.429 --> 00:03:33.095
- There's two.
- Tell me about your home.

00:03:33.095 --> 00:03:35.063
- I don't think we can go home.

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.470
Shouldn't have left.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:37.640
- No, of course not.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.040
Why shouldn't you have left?

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:41.003
- The people we're with aren't good.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:46.430
- Let the amazing wisdom
of the subconscious mind

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:50.440
pull you towards the event that will

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:55.484
illuminate and resolve your ambivalence

00:03:55.484 --> 00:03:57.013
about the ocean.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:58.953
What is happening, Annabelle?

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.340
- We can't stay here anymore.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.550
- No, of course not.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.883
Why do you have to leave?

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.963
- There's a war, and
we goin into the water.

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:10.663
My mother and my aunt are there.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:11.960
- And what's happening?

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:14.170
- I'm pushing their boat into the water

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:16.320
and I'm trying to go
but they pull me back.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.720
They won't let me leave.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.572
- Who's not gonna let you leave?

00:04:19.572 --> 00:04:20.970
- The forces, the other side.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.080
They won't let me leave.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.400
- What happened with the ocean?

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:27.100
Take a nice deep breath and
release any shame associated

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:27.933
with it.

00:04:27.933 --> 00:04:29.770
- I think for sure I drowned in there,

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.483
but it was by accident.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.520
I think I went in looking for something.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.023
- So tell me what you see?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.423
And be brave.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.313
- I left.

00:04:38.313 --> 00:04:39.146
- Yeah.

00:04:39.146 --> 00:04:41.143
You left and who did you leave behind?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.280
- I think I left everyone.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.470
- Did you go by yourself?

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.330
Did you take the boys?

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.163
- No.

00:04:45.511 --> 00:04:48.573
- It's okay, because this
was not a good place for you.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.373
What finally happened?

00:04:50.693 --> 00:04:52.846
- They hit me on the head.
- They hit you on the head?

00:04:52.846 --> 00:04:53.998
And what happened?

00:04:53.998 --> 00:04:55.081
- And I died.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.233
- Yeah.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.803
You're at the moment after death.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.110
And you are going to
go up higher and higher

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:06.620
til you connect with every incarnation

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.463
from all your past lives.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.793
You may ask the question,

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:15.860
how am I able to release the trauma

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:19.693
of wanting to go, but having to stay?

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.143
We're going to go just to
the moment after death.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.250
You are there, how did you die, Alice?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.830
- I just am on the floor.

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.260
- Something just gave out huh?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.423
And where did you feel it in
your body before it happened?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:33.443
You can remember.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.263
- My heart.
- Yeah.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.810
Look at my finger with your eyes closed.

00:05:37.859 --> 00:05:41.143
Look even more with your wisdom.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.850
You can enjoy the ocean.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:47.453
What insider perspective does
the wise self reveal to you?

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:48.573
Speak it out loud.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.360
- There wasn't really a choice.

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.160
- And really listen to your wise self.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.410
Can you allow yourself
to forgive yourself?

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.370
Give me an honest answer.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.460
- I don't know.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:58.450
I thought they'd be fine.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:05:59.950
- When you were Alice,

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:03.163
you didn't have control,
freedom, or power.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.123
Breathe that in and acknowledge it.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:09.140
And now ask, as a daughter
of the 21st century,

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:12.113
is being held back still serving you?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.720
And if it's not, take a
very, very, very deep breath

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.730
and release being held back.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.170
Now I'm gonna ask you a question as Kate.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:22.700
Do you have power, freedom, and choice?

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:23.533
- Yes.

00:06:23.533 --> 00:06:26.020
- You have power, freedom, and choice.

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.240
And one, two, three, four, five, Joyce

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.683
eyes open, wide awake.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.770
One, two, three, four, five.

00:06:35.906 --> 00:06:37.643
- Well I think it was very uncomfortable

00:06:37.643 --> 00:06:39.470
with how intense that was.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:40.360
- It was strange.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.970
I was like her at first,

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:45.163
and then I like became this alligator.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:46.603
- Damn.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.123
I didn't wanna say anything

00:06:48.123 --> 00:06:51.413
I was so like ashamed of
everything I was saying.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.763
- Of course.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:54.830
But your wise self told you

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:57.540
