under those circumstances.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:58.373
- Yeah.

00:06:58.373 --> 00:07:01.460
- Would you trust me that
it stands on it's own

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:04.220
as what has happened to
women for generations

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.710
who truly had no choice.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:06.670
- It taught me a lot.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.580
I usually get a headache
around once a day,

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:11.000
but today I just feel
really calm, really chill.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.970
- I have to figure out what
I feel about all of this.

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.540
If it's a way for us to like personifying

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:18.120
our underlying guilt
from other situations,

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.970
or if I actually believe in past lives.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:21.570
- It was interesting just cause like

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.120
I'm both super spiritual and

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.670
at the same time I try to
be as logical as possible,

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.860
and I'm just like what
was real and what was me?

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.070
It kind of doesn't matter.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:33.440
It was just a really good experience

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:35.570
